{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41406","headline":"送孟宾于 · 马致恭","name":"送孟宾于","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾闻洛下缀神仙，火树南栖几十年。\n白首自忻丹桂在，诗名已得四方传。\n行随秋渚将归雁，吟傍梅花欲雪天。\n今日还家莫惆怅，不同初上渡头船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马致恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}